Package: dbscrape
Title: A Structured Pipeline for Database-Centric Web Scraping
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Dein", "Name", email = "deine@email.de", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Facilitates robust web scraping by providing a job-based interface 
    for defining, validating, and executing data extraction tasks. It supports 
    optional browser simulation and user-agent rotation to bypass anti-scraping 
    blocks, handles error logging, and writes structured data directly to SQL 
    databases via DBI connections, with full support for complex many-to-many 
    relationships.
